 BSE| Energy difference of first occupied index to HOMO [eV]             267.543
 BSE| Energy difference of last empty index to LUMO [eV]                 103.988
 BSE| Number of GW-corrected occupied MOs                                     13
 BSE| Number of GW-corrected empty MOs                                        77
 BSE|
 BSE| No truncation of BSE matrices applied
 BSE|
